
@url = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Listar vehículos
GET {{url}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear vehículo
POST {{url}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "modelo": "Atego",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2022,
  "capacidad_carga": 8000
}

### Modificar vehículo (reemplazar ID)
PUT {{url}}/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "modelo": "Atego 1726",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2023,
  "capacidad_carga": 8500
}

### Eliminar vehículo (reemplazar ID)
DELETE {{url}}/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
